      "notes": "The prospectus lists upward of $430 billion in locked-in cloud computing deals, including with Amazon and Google, and up to $637 billion when cancellable and smaller deals are included. AI infrastructure spending was $9 billion in the first half of 2026, versus $7.3 billion for all of 2025. The net loss through June was $80.7 billion; Yahoo Finance reports the vast majority was accounting charges. The 2025 loss was $42 billion.\n\nSource:\n- Yahoo Finance (Oct 26, 2026): https://finance.yahoo.com/technology/article/anthropic-publicly-files-ipo-prospectus-noting-strong-revenue-growth-and-massive-spending-131807138.html"
