      "notes": "Roadshow launched November 10, 2026. 825,000,000 shares of Class A common stock: 801,351,354 offered by Anthropic and 23,648,646 by existing stockholders (Anthropic gets no proceeds from those). Underwriters have a 30-day option for up to 123,750,000 more shares. Expected price: $70.00 to $78.00 per share. Goldman Sachs & Co. LLC and Morgan Stanley & Co. LLC head the underwriter list. The registration statement has been filed but has not yet become effective. Anthropic has not announced a pricing date.\n\nSources:\n- Anthropic, 'Anthropic launches roadshow for proposed initial public offering' (Nov 10, 2026): https://www.anthropic.com/news/roadshow-launch\n- SEC EDGAR, Form S-1 cover and underwriting table: https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/2130357/000162828026067168/anthropicpbc-sx1.htm"
